{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_11211640","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211640","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121164001:1":{"text":"すみません、最近ルナーランドで何かおかしなことはありませんでしたか？","source_cn":"请问——这两天月影乡里有奇怪的事情发生吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC290BD6EBD1F0578","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121164002:1":{"text":"おかしなこと？神聖な出来事ならあったよ、ついさっきね！","source_cn":"奇怪的事情？倒是有神圣的事情，刚刚就出现在我眼前！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7831660301CC8B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121164003:2":{"text":"今しがた、空を大きな鳥が横切ったんだ。翼がはためくと、羽がまるで炎のように燃えていたんだよ！","source_cn":"刚才空中飞过一只巨鸟，拍动翅膀时，飞羽像火焰一样在燃烧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68E44D1C3F0D2B0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121164004:0":{"text":"この辺であんな鳥を見たのは初めてだ。あまりにも神々しくて、つい見入ってしまったよ。きっとミサタ様の奇跡だ！","source_cn":"之前从来没在山脉见过那样的鸟儿栖息，那景象让我敬畏地停...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B98A02F7DF24C81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1121164004":{"text":"この辺であんな鳥を見たのは初めてだ。あまりにも神々しくて、つい見入ってしまったよ。きっとミサタ様の奇跡だ！","source_cn":"那之前从来没在山脉见过那样的鸟儿栖息，那景象让我敬畏地停下了脚步。那一定也是弥萨忒显灵的神迹吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B98A02F7DF24C81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121164006:1":{"text":"空から捜索しているタレンさんかもしれませんね！","source_cn":"听起来是塔琳小姐在空中搜寻的样子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB211AC54200E5B8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121164007:1":{"text":"何処へ飛んでいったか分かりますか？","source_cn":"她往哪个方向飞去了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD481BD20DF797814","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121164008:3":{"text":"真っすぐ<style=\"highlight\">北へ</style>飛んでいったよ。空に炎の軌跡を残しながらね。","source_cn":"一路<style=highlight>向北</styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x050609123C43CE89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121164009:1":{"text":"あれは人だったのかい！？信じられない……あんなに美しい羽と翼を持つ人がいるなんて……！","source_cn":"那竟然是一位女士吗？！有那么美丽的羽毛和翼展，真是难以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DF5941F6BD8CF56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121164010:1":{"text":"うーん……タレンさんは北へ向かったようですね。北は彼女に任せて、私たちは別のところで聞き込みしましょう。","source_cn":"嗯……听起来塔琳小姐往北方去找了，那边交给她，咱们换个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08DAE5A0AB780D19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document